    "Title": "How to Pass a Kidney Stone & 5 Proven Tips to Prevent Them",
    "P1": "If you’ve ever experienced a kidney stone, you already know how intense the pain can be. \nMost people describe it as one of the worst pains imaginable — and many will face it more \nthan once. Kidney stones affect men more than women, and without preventive care, nearly \n50% of people may develop another stone within 10–15 years.",
